  "definition": {
    "en": "99 × 210 mm — an A4 sheet folded in three along its long side; the trade's «DL» for flyers and brochures, sized to fit the DL envelope (110 × 220). The format is the closed size; the panel widths follow the setup model (equal thirds for a Z-fold, the inner panel 2–3 mm narrower for a letter fold). Not the same term as the DL envelope.",
    "nb": "99 × 210 mm — et A4-ark brettet i tre på langs; bransjens «DL» for flyere og brosjyrer, passer i DL-konvolutten (110 × 220). Formatet er det lukkede målet; panelbreddene følger oppsettsmodellen (like tredeler for Z-fals, innbrettet panel 2–3 mm smalere for wickelfalz). Ikke samme term som DL-konvolutten.",
    "de": "99 × 210 mm — ein A4-Bogen, längs in drei gefalzt; das «DIN lang» der Branche für Flyer und Broschüren, passend für den DL-Umschlag (110 × 220). Das Format ist das geschlossene Maß; die Panelbreiten folgen dem Setup-Modell. Nicht derselbe Begriff wie der DL-Umschlag.",
    "es": "99 × 210 mm — an A4 sheet folded in three along its long side; the trade's «DL» for flyers and brochures, sized to fit the DL envelope (110 × 220). The format is the closed size; the panel widths follow the setup model (equal thirds for a Z-fold, the inner panel 2–3 mm narrower for a letter fold). Not the same term as the DL envelope.",
    "ja": "99 × 210 mm — an A4 sheet folded in three along its long side; the trade's «DL» for flyers and brochures, sized to fit the DL envelope (110 × 220). The format is the closed size; the panel widths follow the setup model (equal thirds for a Z-fold, the inner panel 2–3 mm narrower for a letter fold). Not the same term as the DL envelope.",
    "zh-Hans": "99 × 210 mm — an A4 sheet folded in three along its long side; the trade's «DL» for flyers and brochures, sized to fit the DL envelope (110 × 220). The format is the closed size; the panel widths follow the setup model (equal thirds for a Z-fold, the inner panel 2–3 mm narrower for a letter fold). Not the same term as the DL envelope.",
    "sv": "99 × 210 mm — an A4 sheet folded in three along its long side; the trade's «DL» for flyers and brochures, sized to fit the DL envelope (110 × 220). The format is the closed size; the panel widths follow the setup model (equal thirds for a Z-fold, the inner panel 2–3 mm narrower for a letter fold). Not the same term as the DL envelope.",
    "da": "99 × 210 mm — an A4 sheet folded in three along its long side; the trade's «DL» for flyers and brochures, sized to fit the DL envelope (110 × 220). The format is the closed size; the panel widths follow the setup model (equal thirds for a Z-fold, the inner panel 2–3 mm narrower for a letter fold). Not the same term as the DL envelope.",
    "nl": "99 × 210 mm — an A4 sheet folded in three along its long side; the trade's «DL» for flyers and brochures, sized to fit the DL envelope (110 × 220). The format is the closed size; the panel widths follow the setup model (equal thirds for a Z-fold, the inner panel 2–3 mm narrower for a letter fold). Not the same term as the DL envelope.",
    "pl": "99 × 210 mm — an A4 sheet folded in three along its long side; the trade's «DL» for flyers and brochures, sized to fit the DL envelope (110 × 220). The format is the closed size; the panel widths follow the setup model (equal thirds for a Z-fold, the inner panel 2–3 mm narrower for a letter fold). Not the same term as the DL envelope.",
    "pt": "99 × 210 mm — an A4 sheet folded in three along its long side; the trade's «DL» for flyers and brochures, sized to fit the DL envelope (110 × 220). The format is the closed size; the panel widths follow the setup model (equal thirds for a Z-fold, the inner panel 2–3 mm narrower for a letter fold). Not the same term as the DL envelope.",
